!!<*yamlover: $defs: chapter>
Multi-document streams (reserved)
description: several ---separated documents in one file — defined, not yet implemented
- |
  One file holding several `---`-separated documents is the reserved pair `multi-yaml`
  and `multi-yamlover`: each document an element of the singular concrete. The parser
  currently rejects document streams; the concretes are defined and reserved, and no
  node carries one today.
